   "texts": {
    "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_MetOlderGirlAtPike": "Crunch, munch…\\pA while back, I met this older girl\\nat the BATTLE PIKE.\\pShe had these eyes that were scary\\nin a real ornery way.\\pCrunch, munch…\\pShe got all furious: “Will you quit\\neating!” Then she whaled on me.\\pIt was a hair-raising kind of\\nscary experience, sure enough.\\pCrunch, munch…$"
   }
