   "texts": {
    "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_DomeAceIsMine": "Oh, shush!\\nKeep that racket down!\\pYou fair-weather fans should stick\\nto cheering for some GYM LEADER!\\pThe DOME ACE is mine!\\nThe only idol for me!$"
